I think these would be called "definition variables" in the SEM world. This functionality is not currently available in blavaan.

I thought about ways to possibly hack it using mcmcextra, but I am not sure that could be done either. It would be possible to generate the JAGS syntax for a blavaan model without the definition variables, then edit the JAGS file yourself to include the definition variables. But in that case, it becomes more of a JAGS model than a blavaan model.

Ed

